  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec62dcc096ec69937919ef12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来也得努力了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4acbad8377184ce1172d683e5d14e9979c6169745d07b2b1175ded184e508c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55fb4b07fc64727a349cdb06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样也算是半开了吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "978d3eea7980b838ce70309fb04f6deed23fd9c9fc84590ac022a6ec2b59be50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f90efdeb67e001d6a72842dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "距离那个心中憧憬的模样，我还差得远啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "64dbeaa4c55b53b0f23321e11f8f5c01d9155cd724d69569f24303036b4c61be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93e513c1345ec1d4b1043346",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迄今为止的努力……一定能让我盛放于此！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4692cab997da650295eaf77dc4840c620422a18efadf7c5cd13ddc1f9334e089",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a6c9cdba7fbf80fb3fa4d19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……现在能盛放吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c05a2e6a7e175c0b0da1037f0e8efdab6f888dfcf7ca2cafcc7b3873d60f97f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:915504c345decd46926637a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只属于我的步伐比任何人都华丽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c604d315abeea53887cb8f0ec67a06071d6bb4925c57c095b2b92e9432206ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f88afb9ecd19dfb768cf643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是否盛开了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfc2fc78e9a4d57399e4d10acc85ffe9e3fa7e96dacf63b59c74fb7604b43aff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8f4953b31f8ffe4490fd2a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以满开作为目标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "133b73061919b928115354e078a197bd831f2499bf14681e6bf8bef1476ee2f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f8c3927ae20a96e9181850",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正是满开之时——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b9755533a77a4a2dc87286c1a8d55883a46ad851fa81ec9b50752f5111d21a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c14f15250e4eab8864d040f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「种下种子，白萝卜长成白萝卜，\r\n胡萝卜长成胡萝卜！」。\r\n我的目标是成为最佳舞伴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "014f2d147f13ddb87cac4dd2b5a92e7725ffa5aadc5e433fd24d718b07a22d7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95da175f670a0a74556433f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会好好努力通过预赛的！\r\n不知道丸善斯基前辈\r\n会不会也为我开心呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "49ac15d96c3c2582b2dc2fbd2f03087a3ffc2d14baf8b9be292db119f35b6659",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf128bb7a696e2e48d8d1b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本以为自己明白这所学园有许多\r\n「特别」之处……但原来真的还只是\r\n「自以为」而已……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f109e4c1e434e9603588c3ef9fb729c0a8dc71c1ab5b40ffc03fb74d30bfe4ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16e2a1ce8b1615c6c320c815",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该买什么礼物好呢～？\r\n我想要能跟丸善斯基前辈凑成一对的东西，\r\n开玩笑的……嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09d364ca8dfda77be8e39e5256ab94bd3b31f5551fc8b373233ffaab87d1c8f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8464a08360a97fceba45aaa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的愿望……迄今为止的努力……\n一切都是为了此刻！\n现在正是满开之时！",
      "source_fingerprint": "964aa719fe7d478a4d0766b8b5e6af5d3530d859341e3c7a5b65c0378cfb369b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f3572801d688e71d4ad38c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是所谓的\r\n「活动任务，近在眼前」呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "315d024735ceab7a29fee37498c8accdb35d8cef3f7fbeb31bb41cf553c84967",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ca779bfd3d16b4f883075a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，辛苦了！\r\n没忘记领取奖品吧？\r\n不然就太可惜了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a86cd3179427108b2e400d1194e4fb28f3625370e61b4d04cdfaa62db0875cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1365d1b16c07ced81651f0d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飘散吧！意志的樱花纷飞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f617102fde04edad5a62528034ade0022565cba8cb8d8a7466a1d77b1a19467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54adcc5dcd07c177b5770c15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我随心之所向，\r\n展现出此刻绝无仅有的樱花吧！\r\n喝啊！耶嘿嘿♪♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f64272a083ea0fac7880e2842432d1c917e9257aff714fa87552d04685f51b63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e5de17ca84e401ff524b0e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我想战胜的对手变多了。\r\n虽然现在的我可能还实力不足，\r\n但我一定会想办法弥补这些差距的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39018dc2b03e498395ad2c125dd8b48b656ef080dab06fd7be5c176e2655b600",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "400049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:800fcfcc75f8ebd5008104c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a048816601878f09a8951aadc34edf1f66b7cbb43bb1d5e45d6ee0ce85a4d890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48f4367903f6a187fdf7783e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2deba7ca30c98238317c64bb01282f7578b945b19432461c4536c6681ac4b8ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1019e718c62c60810a983256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19a7e8d715c640700e8d81b179d2ec702bab36bb8d77ec39a07f3d4b2ff0e4c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21eed199fc9f43c626507233",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19a7e8d715c640700e8d81b179d2ec702bab36bb8d77ec39a07f3d4b2ff0e4c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a906c20d8841cf1e1f2affb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b9fb8f85ffa4d290e10079c9147225ace3be731d4cbfaab625830e9e9dc692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:502b7ef7648898ee5769245d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b9fb8f85ffa4d290e10079c9147225ace3be731d4cbfaab625830e9e9dc692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f04633f89c4048b66510593",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊、啊哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "176dda0caf136b263b9d20be229dda9ff7e215b859239544efd6dd5f750062a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e210bf4b9819fdb346280e58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊、啊哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "176dda0caf136b263b9d20be229dda9ff7e215b859239544efd6dd5f750062a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54565edb20f2e4c710c2c40e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊、啊哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "176dda0caf136b263b9d20be229dda9ff7e215b859239544efd6dd5f750062a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a4e0b44ff3da0837e66099a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会全力以赴的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14bc4d6f2124da1449d17fc704806189444cbbe87f80bd476a7fe7a9299793b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7da480cb37a7b8a5eee4639e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍等，我翻一下千代笔记！\n嗯嗯嗯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a6384b0524d6baf78d070eb377336e99fe83ee7bd90a19809c48cf503e493e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b2baa17cd589b0263380b44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到梦想实现的那一天，请您一直陪着我哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1208d2237e6202882e0733c9d4b4ef250c2eec6e96891bed05aa93afee07a3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8302f0a66be9a88a75572e19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论遇上什么困难，只要我\n还心怀憧憬，一切就不会结束……\n告诉我这个道理的正是训练员哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aea73e6e7ccc5892bf4875fbd96a0a9001d0587ad38ae1006d30e50c2e470de5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d3994c97e9409cb67150380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噔噔噔！这是作为特雷森赛马娘的证明哦♪\n…还挺像模像样的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dce8362a8e127a1af647fdf6820571e9247e994af4ec574eb0557dc0fea5be4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3fa0f24836dbb8d2299f0ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然唱歌和跳舞都是刚刚接触，\n但继续学习的话一定能学会的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a06d51cf540b1bfc24105379ba29b625899c52e1b9f1522143e7e3f4a523ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a748f506369ab02720bebe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然现在还只是脆弱的花蕾……\n但我坚信，我终有一日会开放的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ae478d4aba1334aff0777a75b0b204136207587df07fb0c7e1d11383033a9fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d5fab4002e86c369ed2b991",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时都要保持容貌端正！正襟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77cfbbea620bcc9856d6cebcaeba01e1999231eb822dccd97a8106a34dbd4af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b38ef4435886693384a28a20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然在大家面前跳舞还是有些紧张……\n不过也有因为我的舞蹈而开心的人，所以我也得加把劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2f5fbad6d785ee5dd22eb1a8a76a2a4687ffe013dec69c7ada7d24fd7348e41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b28bf59f456960b26d53d4a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把袖子这样轻舞的话——\n不觉得就有点像飘舞的樱花吗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a29f9ffbee9e4ed9c0abd377f4c46e2431c7e06f215d9c67dfc2bad538c885f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df7df34c612605edff06803d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好漂亮～！\r\n「人靠衣装，千代也靠衣装」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "302ac6fab2b26a43134b49e505959d204a3ad87494e2b96e79f0b26272e5bb44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2acf93281a63b4f9b1999350",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，这套衣服会让我忍不住\r\n尽情轻飘飘地跑来跑去呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cc793800646305e5d519bb090fb4e8625fee86cf0ffca2768aa02e87ad2c474",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a519ac2142774e0719e39de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有这么多衣服可以换，真开心啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2a36d986b6432ab19c25b9aac3205c066e3a39999ed9c69db696ba9e67e360",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f2bb6f2de90effd0a4844f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得心跳不止激动不已呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d835a39525ff0bc1fb5a55b152a8a2ec5a95d281aa7204396e2f710bfef1697e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eab73980b5fe9f4f6a434d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "V领的V，\r\n是Victory的Vー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39c132ffdcb2e139a8aae691438428397295bfd94eb1a45a8d02ccc8abef2f2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e8294537d9fd6428290fc36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使是常服，我也\r\n相当引人注目呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9efdf7a69935245368a3f581d4a998ee10dc97ce69557a829b4fd23b9851fa44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffc1e71b611a9edb017e65fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噔噔噔！这是作为特雷森赛马娘的证明哦♪\n…还挺像模像样的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dce8362a8e127a1af647fdf6820571e9247e994af4ec574eb0557dc0fea5be4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aeb68b44a903f5d576e89f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然唱歌和跳舞都是刚刚接触，\n但继续学习的话一定能学会的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a06d51cf540b1bfc24105379ba29b625899c52e1b9f1522143e7e3f4a523ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58297dd2982807542cda0de5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然现在还只是脆弱的花蕾……\n但我坚信，我终有一日会开放的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ae478d4aba1334aff0777a75b0b204136207587df07fb0c7e1d11383033a9fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42d59886e0827f85604eacf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时都要保持容貌端正！正襟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77cfbbea620bcc9856d6cebcaeba01e1999231eb822dccd97a8106a34dbd4af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e12c5cc4bcc7b465f8ae3c34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然在大家面前跳舞还是有些紧张……\n不过也有因为我的舞蹈而开心的人，所以我也得加把劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2f5fbad6d785ee5dd22eb1a8a76a2a4687ffe013dec69c7ada7d24fd7348e41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe69702d908696f30ac2e93f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把袖子这样轻舞的话——\n不觉得就有点像飘舞的樱花吗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a29f9ffbee9e4ed9c0abd377f4c46e2431c7e06f215d9c67dfc2bad538c885f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b29487bef554a4e81b5f67c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好漂亮～！\r\n「人靠衣装，千代也靠衣装」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "302ac6fab2b26a43134b49e505959d204a3ad87494e2b96e79f0b26272e5bb44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d45cd0165cf048170d1c77ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，这套衣服会让我忍不住\r\n尽情轻飘飘地跑来跑去呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cc793800646305e5d519bb090fb4e8625fee86cf0ffca2768aa02e87ad2c474",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f4c0b4c44237a18c22ccb85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有这么多衣服可以换，真开心啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2a36d986b6432ab19c25b9aac3205c066e3a39999ed9c69db696ba9e67e360",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb77f97d1b6c875421c841f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得心跳不止激动不已呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d835a39525ff0bc1fb5a55b152a8a2ec5a95d281aa7204396e2f710bfef1697e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9755770aa7cceb4ed3bc76f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df094ff1112517c623c111a7239f2b6398134743fb570a85aa6a2f9f1f8889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac5c686ec8049a8cae37281",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "预备～一起喊！胜利～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb9a2cd4da88854a7241f2e63619c746374853c1ca6f7fa1fbd9ae948435b867",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "8007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:596d0aa847270039eb8fd572",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是要切磋吗？\r\n那就来比比谁能\r\n绽放得更绚丽吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "361f919c3087a6a9c3603d8dd1f3c635315b6ec1816d76f363b3f0e010cddd09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76629581224983cfb25100e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是难缠的对手呢…！\r\n既然如此，我也要\r\n再为您绽放一朵花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aa1ef3287c0f177bd8d5eb67cf7fe1a88451c6a9067b5fa927cc2fe6193e0a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60952e9a4193152103bfaf8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！\n正所谓『好的问候胜过好的萝卜』！\n今天也请您多多关照！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45eebeb939cc04213d0a7a9058e61a7088a1b1fcba321aee7b4910efc7e65bf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97afb3884c6efb6e0801fb81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『睡眼惺忪的早晨才蕴涵着胜机』！\n今天我起床之后，立马就去做了体操，\n现在身心舒畅哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c6d3ced601ca6f0e1f556dc0a4d82c316e892dddbb6ddd4dd0e172eecb7f0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0fc3aef54fda42fd63f9935",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您吃过午饭了吗？正所谓『要想过上\n好的一天就得吃上好的午饭』！\n吃饱了下午才有力气继续努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f1b975c70c91c2c10e6c867640e47b7e37d1fb246de708eb297250d3f4868fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b99c8ec7792b64792433dc19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『今天的红豆馅会变作明天的悔恨』。\n买来的点心实在是太好吃了，\n有些抵挡不住它的诱惑啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "90293d846d620a1309338c06aa7a4399c150b95606893b25bacf11ef70d2e241",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43e3a1ab538d2fa47a0a3e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经这个时间了吗……\n俗话说『不睡觉的话太阳就不会升起』！\n今天可要记得好好休息哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "234f9dac626d302889a6b74d89b5db390778f1d9176a849baf33fb8e88749742",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9704fa5c98107a9227a9f755",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经快要到第二天了呀……\n我不管有多困，\n睡前都会反省一下今天的所作所为呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ec10db28f2455cf731337ef468bcd79b3e3e4da98d1810100cfbc999caaad62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f104f652d0891ae3f9768b13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『凡赛马娘皆有春来之日』！\n春天和我的名字很相称呢～\n一想到这个，就觉得可以继续努力了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33d1a6f8a37732ae6d91a7520998ff5b8755e47a6637a9856f929a4bbc90dcc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14eafce04cfe6d77f4053d27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『补充水分能够打开身心的池塘』！\n注意好自己的身体状况，\n一起度过充实的夏天吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69274ff0133e059dc11b4e76efed816e1f447500708db52f41604892d97b8653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e821f2b15db9f15facb4f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『一万个人眼中有一万种秋季』呢！\n训练员喜欢怎样的秋天呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1acafd04e014fd8d212e67a253e1e9c6ed52492516fbcd08abe2b9a89fbcc0ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfbd0a00307220f57d7da4da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『身体比大脑更早察觉到寒意』！\n嘿嘿，我的防寒对策非常完美哦！\n为了不败给寒冷，今天也加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52e8e97bf0196817203b4288049b2d641a58b4ba4693f5eb33335cc254cc2982",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a58d100ca063431517a7f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上起床的心情如何？\r\n跟我同寝室的阿尔丹同学似乎\r\n不太擅长立刻清醒过来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a5d0f75269da158e46a6186659871bacc0dd542ac5e63f0404a1053914df6b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab6c2deb89e9871992b3a18a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～～啊，早上好！\r\n感觉我的心境也随着这件衣服，\r\n变得既温暖又开朗了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b600bf7e0eaf7da0f7b9b67c65617e00076bb241939caa24e4b95dfb62f66b90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b3eb532e393398635132fd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千代午安！\r\n啊，没什么，我只是想试试看有没有\r\n充满我个人风格的午间问候……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee57c864cc73c17d99658b7df2620ab3eff21077b0844e05497f9ecb95130b18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0df409d1de39b9fbd6744ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才我在食堂吃的红豆面包上，\r\n点缀了盐渍樱花哦！\r\n咸咸的非常美味！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ccb8b5a23b6f356a97a68ab0c7f02346ee905d4434af072b91c359f23256abe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7503230ca6b8342113d17fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我想成为美丽的夜樱……\r\n似乎还缺少了一点点\r\n成熟的氛围呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c38c9403af40f2c3b6fd3bfe8f20decb326785fe4b1f5cfdb7807b5bd2995665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19f962a73162371d6175ad4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上好。\r\n这、这可不是睡衣哦？\r\n是一件非常珍贵的衣服……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "165d0cea8cab654de95977bc7ca65bdb362edaaec042719ecc84bdc2b4d4352f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4722918438a38a071f1776e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「春之晨晓」！\r\n这句……应该不会出现在\r\n古文考试里吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "32776e22204012c106294da8cb3da85864299fd3c7743c2283134fae43203892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17705db4938fa6db4679e80d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手臂好像有点晒黑了呢。\r\n不过这恰到好处的黑还带点华丽感，\r\n感觉也挺适合我的……？\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "381c341539f1b13fd5d79460637ddca68687296b1d3edeff07b504b6e9f4d24e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9abd8e1fa8623d068cab1e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想秉持着\r\n「秋天是努力『求』取的季节！」的\r\n精神来挑战每一件事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b823bb48f2090247889d2ff0e3d162dc869fc4091f6b4176124bbae2b05e4183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1274607a306ce1f8de649f65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢的冬季运动\r\n当然是滑雪啦！\r\n感觉丸善斯基前辈也会很擅长呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3d434f572c2f6c365afc5972f469cc01a418627acc50d37ac5f7ce18be4392",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edda94fa8fc8007cba5363ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93615d4eb7c22973ff54e919",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90021"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
